# Diluc Chongyun Yaoyao Xianyun. ~16s Rot. Diluc Melt Plunge. Uses Diluc E to (re)establish Burning aura to Melt plunge. Chongyun uses E before Xianyun. 50% Collisions. The 8th high plunge isn't melted and the timing for the 7th is tight.

# Team - Options listed by DPS
diluc char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
diluc add weapon="serpent" refine=1 lvl=90/90 +params=[stacks=5];
